        "nobel_worthiness": "The Higgs discovery completed a central test of the Standard Model and stands among the defining achievements of experimental particle physics.",
        "attribution": "These leaders were instrumental in conceiving and building ATLAS and CMS, whose independent results established the discovery. Credit must reflect the enormous collaboration effort.",
        "maturity": "The signal has been confirmed across channels and studied for more than a decade; the result is exceptionally secure.",
