        "nobel_worthiness": "The detection of high-energy astrophysical neutrinos opened a new observational window on the nonthermal Universe and established neutrino astronomy.",
        "attribution": "Halzen's scientific leadership and long effort to realize IceCube were central, while the measurements themselves are a major collective achievement.",
        "maturity": "The astrophysical neutrino flux is established and subsequent observations have strengthened the case, although identifying individual sources remains difficult.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Recognizing one person for a large detector collaboration risks understating the contributions of the wider IceCube team."
        ]
      }
    },
