        "nobel_worthiness": "Locating gamma-ray burst afterglows and establishing the bursts' cosmological distances transformed high-energy astrophysics.",
        "attribution": "Costa and Frontera were central to the BeppoSAX observations that enabled rapid localization, and Kulkarni led key afterglow follow-up work.",
        "maturity": "The cosmological origin is firmly established, with later observations building a mature field.",
        "uncertainties": [
